  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Numeric operators and aggregates (unary +/-, avg, sum, min, max, round-half-to-even, abs, ceiling, floor) now handle derived integer types (xs:long, xs:int, ...) correctly and exactly. array:sort now honors the collation (default/declared or supplied) instead of always sorting by codepoint. Serialization: a free-standing attribute under the xml/html method now raises SENR0001; the xml/html methods escape CR/NEL/LINE-SEPARATOR/C1 controls as numeric character references. Cost-based optimizer: scan cost scales with container size and value-specific selectivity comes from the index catalog. Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.8. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
